        "id": "68f632c684707710e3d75a18",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was spotless.\nI was very happy with the location.\nI was very satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nWe took this vacation to get all the little cousins together. It was the first time they had all been on a trip together and this amazing house made it so comfortable and fun! The best part of this house was the fact that each family unit had their own room with a bathroom and the bunk room was the highlight for all the little boys. The living space was the perfect size to feel together but also not cramped. The back patio and pool were a great addition to have on this trip, especially after beach time when we could just rinse off in the outdoor shower and then just hop right in the pool.",
        "title": "ACRE Family Fun"
      },
      {
        "author": "Suzanne O.",
        "date": "2025-07-06T22:07:27Z",
        "id": "686b022c3e2b8d29776afdf4",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Our week at Reel Deal was so much fun. The space was perfect for our large family. The host was excellent and answered any questions or concerns asap. There were a few things that we thought would make the stay even better and our suggestions were welcomed. The house is well stocked with everything you need. It's an easy walk to the beach. We will be back",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Beautiful home and wonderful host",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Peter U.",
        "date": "2024-05-05T20:59:07Z",
        "id": "6637f31cc8f1b0480292a3e9",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We had a great time in this house. It’s an easy walk to beach, with plenty of space for 16 people.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Amazing getaway",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Tammy C.",
        "date": "2025-06-16T09:48:00Z",
        "id": "68516c9e1e444159b6dc05b6",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Rating Details:\nThe property manager was very helpful.\nThe vacation rental was spotless.\nI was very happy with the location.\nI was very satisfied with the condition of the vacation rental.\nOverall, I recommend this vacation rental.\n\nReviewer Comments:\nThis home was beautiful and very clean. The owner was beyond helpful with every question we had. The walk to the beach was not bad at all. Ice cream, donuts, taco restaurant all within a block of the house. The pool was a huge plus, and had a good amount of sun and shade.",
        "title": "Great Home"
      },
      {
        "author": "diane s.",
        "date": "2025-04-26T16:43:11Z",
        "id": "680d1b5d70ce972c882aa753",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "A wonderful property for our family of all ages. The kids loved the pool, everyone loved the easy access to the beach, the 6 bathrooms and lovely indoor and outdoor spaces. Enough room for all 17 of us. Golf cart was a hit and so practical. Could have used some more bath towels and the outdoor fp wasn’t working.",
